  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega_{f}^{2}=0+2\\times 0.110\\times 6\\times 2\\pi\"></span>  ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega_{f}=2.88 rad s^{-1}\"></span> ✓   Other methods are possible.<br/>Answer 3 given so look for correct working<br/>At least 2 sig figs for MP2.</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p>concave up from origin ✓</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_03\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 3\" src=\"asset:fig_03\"/></figure></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Γ=I \\alpha so Γ=0.110\\times 0.0216= 2.38\\times 10^{-3} N m\"></span> ✓</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"d\"><p><strong>d</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha=\\frac{2.9^{2}}{2\\times 2\\pi\\times 30}=\"></span> OR <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-0.022 rad s^{-2}\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t =\\frac{\\omega_{f}-\\omega_{i}}{\\alpha}=\\frac{-2.9}{-0.0220}=130s\"></span>✓   Other methods are possible. Allow <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"131 s\"></span> if <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.88\"></span> used Allow <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"126 s\"></span> if <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3\"></span> used Award [2] marks for a bald correct answer</p></section>"
